@startuml
!theme plain
title MCP Discovery Flow

actor User as "User/Developer"
participant LLM as "LLM Agent"
participant Client as "MCP Client"
participant Server as "MCP Server"

== Initialization ==

User -> Client: Start MCP server
activate Client
Client -> Server: Start ./plan mcp start
activate Server
Server --> Client: MCP server ready
deactivate Client

== Discovery Phase ==

User -> LLM: What can you do with the planning tool?
activate LLM
LLM -> Client: get_capabilities()
activate Client
Client -> Server: Tool call
Server --> Client: Return capabilities JSON
deactivate Client
Client --> LLM: API specification
LLM --> User: I can manage facts - list, get, create, update, delete

== Execution Phase ==

User -> LLM: Create a fact for API URL
LLM -> Client: execute(request JSON)
activate Client
Client -> Server: Tool call with request
Server --> Client: Success response
Client --> LLM: Fact created
LLM --> User: Created fact API URL
deactivate LLM
deactivate Client
deactivate Server

@enduml